cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the dissertation below."
title: "fire-label-quality: labeling strategies for satellite fire hotspot classification in the MATOPIBA region"
abstract: >-
  Five independent label sources for the same NASA FIRMS fire detections in the Brazilian
  MATOPIBA region, with 22 engineered features per detection and the pipeline that
  reproduces the comparison between them. Includes 604 detections annotated under a blind
  protocol. Code is licensed under MIT, data and documentation under CC BY 4.0.
type: dataset
